        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Semi detached three bedroom house.\r\nQuiet cul de sac location.\r\nSouth facing garden to the rear.\r\nConveniently located within walking distance of amenities in Drogheda town centre.\r\nExtending to approximately 87 sq. m (936 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a semi detached three bedroom house with a garden to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 87 sq. m (936 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
